  "aboutPage": {
    "whoAreWe": "Who are we?",
    "donate": "Donate",
    "donateLink": "https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/electrodanceworld",
    "join": "Join us",
    "joinLink": "https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdXaDsFXTOJefSkYOxxsz2T9esfl0TUzguqp_rlGaq6OGS26w/viewform",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Do you like electronic music? Would you like to discover and enjoy all the styles that exist? Then, this is the project you've been looking for.",
      "We are the only electronic music project that encompasses all possible styles of electronic music in one place. From Techno to Trance, including House, Dubstep, Ambient, and many more. There are over 300 genres and subgenres of electronic music with their separate communities. We want to break down those barriers and create one big electronic family.",
      "Our mission is to spread and give visibility to electronic music in all its styles and areas, bringing it closer to communities that cannot access it due to their different abilities. We want electronic music to be inclusive, diverse, and accessible to all. That's why we organize events, workshops, talks, and activities to promote electronic culture among different audiences.",
      "Our goal is to support new talents, parties, festivals, and bring electronic music to communities that cannot enjoy it naturally. To show how diverse, multicultural, and multi-style electronic music is — there are more than 300 styles, and every year more than 5 new ones are created, did you know? That's why we have an international team of volunteers passionate about our mission, working every day to make it a reality.",
      "If you want to be part of this project, you can contact us through our social media or our website. We'll welcome you with open arms and ears ready for the best electronic music in the world."
    ],
